    "enUS": {
      "description": "Hello, young hunter. You look to me like you are skilled enough to handle a beast and train it as your companion.\n\nYou must see Thotar at Razor Hill. He can put you on the path to earning a pet of your own.",
      "summary": "Speak with Thotar at Razor Hill.",
      "title": "The Hunter's Path",
